<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $60-1/2 (FIM 284.57).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $60-1/2 (FIM 284.57).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR closed up $0-7/8 at $60-1/2 -- its highest since October 20, 1995 -- in New York on Wednesday. It earlier hit an intrasession high of $62.</p>
<p>Nokia's Wall Street closing equals about 284.57 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki on Wednesday, Nokia A closed up 18.50 markka at 290.50 after hitting 291.50.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) ended unchanged at $35-1/4 on Wall Street on Wednesday. The price equals about 82.90 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed up 0.50 markka at 82.50.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR was untraded in New York on Wednesday. In Helsinki, Rauma closed up 1.00 markka at 96.00 markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 235</p>
